# A stage0 sample program (docs/refined-examples/stage0/samples). Run it with
# `refined run`, or compile it with stage0 and run what stage0 builds.

outEscape is project
outEscape purpose "An audit program just outside the stage0 subset, which refined accepts; stage0 refuses it"
outEscape target console
outEscape version "0.1.0"
outEscape language refined 1
outEscape standardLibrary 1
outEscape allows write console.stdout none
outEscape requires none
outEscape includesModule outEscape
outEscape entry outEscape.main
